Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: adapt MT6897 CCIF and DPMAIF transport
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt CCIF and DPMAIF to MT6897 resources and kernel APIs. Preserve
interrupt startup gating, empty-DATA0 handling and shared-memory layout.

